{"id":10339,"bangumiId":10339,"type":2,"name":"青の祓魔師","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-04-17","year":"2011","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/e2/06/10339_UJ5JJ.jpg"},"summary":"青之驱魔师所写的世界由两个空间组成，并像镜般连为一体。人类居住的物质界为本作舞台，另外还有恶魔居住的虚无界。平常基本上无法接触或穿梭于两界之间。可是恶魔能凭依于相当的物质从而进入人类的世界。撒旦乃众魔之神，为了从人间捡回一个能抑制他的箱子，而诞下了奥村磷——他跟一人界女子的儿子。可是撒旦的密谋未能得到到磷的认同。及后撒旦更杀掉了磷的监护人养父，并要带磷返去虚无界。这使磷开始了驱魔师之旅，就为了打败他的生父撒旦。","rating":{"rank":2344,"total":7007,"count":{"1":17,"2":17,"3":37,"4":117,"5":435,"6":1469,"7":2477,"8":1734,"9":378,"10":326},"score":7.1},"collection":{"on_hold":813,"dropped":536,"wish":1898,"collect":9509,"doing":2001},"tags":[{"name":"青の祓魔師","count":1556,"total_count":1779},{"name":"兄弟","count":976,"total_count":1684},{"name":"热血","count":882,"total_count":219838},{"name":"2011年4月","count":761,"total_count":24022},{"name":"福山潤","count":630,"total_count":5233},{"name":"JUMP","count":562,"total_count":33857},{"name":"TV","count":456,"total_count":1453347},{"name":"神谷浩史","count":433,"total_count":30190},{"name":"花澤香菜","count":356,"total_count":6987},{"name":"恶魔","count":307,"total_count":1012},{"name":"2011","count":292,"total_count":54158},{"name":"冈本信彦","count":284,"total_count":1407},{"name":"尼桑","count":239,"total_count":243},{"name":"战斗","count":238,"total_count":493284},{"name":"漫画改","count":234,"total_count":896085},{"name":"A-1Pictures","count":227,"total_count":148581},{"name":"蓝色驱魔师","count":181,"total_count":183},{"name":"2011四月番","count":167,"total_count":320},{"name":"奇幻","count":158,"total_count":495345},{"name":"漫改","count":103,"total_count":371403},{"name":"游佐浩二","count":77,"total_count":527},{"name":"日本","count":48,"total_count":318663},{"name":"青之驱魔